4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dKnKtuR3VOcQ7kNvwEzwdGW&_nc_oc=Adqsii8UJetr6iGCLgRrDjNm_-rrbE46EaE4ZXy8eWA9TGls275nQp3AX7-lVm0AwiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGHW34KFJgma9gcvxyHH0i93I2XIbF9uPH1kcwEx4GyMQ&oe=6A7334D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cVP5sh0MOpIQ7kNvwHdLaQS&_nc_oc=AdpfrZf908rvF0JXd1sLcYpX__2bzKPVlbgRyMK0GQWgTYo1vXyHW2OxmEQOhZF8bFo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFGnHbPYVes9rSo-b9YQ_aFDbAkfJBfg87aaLmXRLmq-w&oe=6A7339B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nW0uaUYcoG0Q7kNvwFe-mB8&_nc_oc=Adoef8Lg0BeMGCY3bxof5zZdOs8J5ube92KgyDPsMxsl-_qq5sa4H3UAcig_o4eBlyU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFOomDj2s8TRtaKjWofNXsbl7_HvRdy-xtcnm2VmWEkDw&oe=6A734755"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p